# An allow-list: everything is left out of the build context, then the few paths the image needs
# are let back in. The working tree holds gitignored private files, and a build context ignores
# .gitignore, so a deny-list here would have to name each of them and would miss the next one.
*
!src/
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!docker/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
